# Kernel-checked enclosures of the Fejer/Joukowski Fourier coefficients

`bLit` encloses the 48 actual coefficients `bR n` of the contour
self-potential.  The literals are proposed by `tools/ca-contour/gen_fourier.py`
and every one of them is re-verified below:
* `cos (π/2^k)` from `cos (π/2) = 0` and the half-angle formula;
* `cos (m π/64)`, `m < 128`, by the Chebyshev recurrence;
* the moments from the literal Appendix A contour weights.
-/

